        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>NF-κB信号通路与Notch信号通路</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 24px 30px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", sans-serif;\n    max-width: 540px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 10px 0 22px 0;\n  }\n  p.body-text {\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  /* ---- Slide 1 ---- */\n  .slide {\n    margin: 0 auto 30px auto;\n  }\n  .slide1 {\n    width: 400px;\n    margin-left: 60px;\n  }\n  .slide-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #d9c9c0;\n    padding-bottom: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .slide-logo {\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #e8d5cc;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .slide-logo-text {\n    font-size: 5px;\n    color: #b09a90;\n  }\n  .slide-title {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n  }\n  .diagram-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin: 18px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .level-box {\n    background: #eceaea;\n    padding: 8px 6px;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    text-align: center;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .branch-col {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .branch-box {\n    background: #fbf1ec;\n    padding: 6px 22px;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    text-align: center;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .caption-small {\n    font-size: 6.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #3a3a3a;\n    margin: 10px 0 0 30px;\n  }\n  /* ---- Slide 2 ---- */\n  .slide2 {\n    width: 400px;\n    margin-left: 60px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #f4f2f6;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd6e0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #7a7a7a;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .fig-notch {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 150px;\n    margin: 6px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .slide2-footer {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 30px;\n    font-size: 7.5px;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .cite {\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .bullet::before {\n    content: \"• \";\n  }\n  .speaker {\n    margin-left: auto;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 16px;\n    background: #d9d9d9;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 6px;\n    color: #666;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>NF-κB信号通路</h1>\n\n<p class=\"body-text\">相对于RTK相关信号通路，NF-KB信号通路的功能也更加特化一些，与TGF-β和Wnt信号相比高度集中于炎症反应。</p>\n\n<div class=\"slide slide1\">\n  <div class=\"slide-header\">\n    <div class=\"slide-logo\"><span class=\"slide-logo-text\">[illegible]</span></div>\n    <div class=\"slide-title\">经典NF-KB信号的功能</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"diagram-row\">\n    <div class=\"level-box\">细胞水平</div>\n    <div class=\"branch-col\">\n      <div class=\"branch-box\">细胞增殖和凋亡</div>\n      <div class=\"branch-box\">炎症细胞的活化</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"level-box\">个体水平</div>\n    <div class=\"branch-col\">\n      <div class=\"branch-box\">肿瘤发生和发展</div>\n      <div class=\"branch-box\">炎症反应</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"caption-small\">\n    相对于RTK相关信号通路，NF-KB信号通路的功能也更加特化一些，与TGF-β和Wnt信号相比，<br>\n    高度集中于炎症反应。\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h1>Notch信号通路</h1>\n\n<p class=\"body-text\">通过膜蛋白作为配体和受体，介导两个细胞相互靠近接触之后的活化效应。Notch 与配体结合，经过 ADAM 剪切释放胞外段与配体一同降解，经 y-secretase 剪切释放胞内段传导信号 Notch 胞内段进入细胞质传导信号。</p>\n\n<div class=\"slide slide2\">\n  <div class=\"slide-header\">\n    <div class=\"slide-logo\"><span class=\"slide-logo-text\">[illegible]</span></div>\n    <div class=\"slide-title\">Notch信号通路的调控</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder fig-notch\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n    [Diagram: Notch signaling pathway schematic, centered — receptor/ligand cleavage steps, endosome, nucleus; internal labels illegible]\n  </figure>\n\n  <div class=\"slide2-footer\">\n    <span class=\"cite\">Chris Siebel and Urban Lendahl, Physiol Rev, 2017</span>\n    <span class=\"bullet\">Notch配体的成熟受到调控</span>\n    <span class=\"speaker\">[Icon: speaker]</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
